Tux, the Linux mascot
=====================

Larry Ewing's Tux artwork, sourced from the SVG rendition at:
https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tux.svg

Original raster by Larry Ewing (lewing@isc.tamu.edu), created with The
GIMP. Permission is granted to copy, modify and distribute this image
provided the original artist is credited.

The PNG distributed with open-media-drc is an unmodified
transparent-background rasterization of that SVG (artwork/Tux.svg.webp),
scaled to 192 pixels high without changing its aspect ratio.
